; Balance assertions compare against a running total that the parser
; keeps for each account.  Each section below exercises one way that
; total could go stale; `--verify` (in builds with VERIFY_ON) also checks
; every cached total against a full rescan of the account.

; Out of date order: a later-dated posting is written first.  Assertions
; dated before it must leave it out; assertions dated after it count it.
2024/03/01 Future deposit
    Assets:Bank                         $100
    Income:Salary

2024/01/01 Opening
    Assets:Bank                          $10 = $10
    Equity:Opening

2024/01/02 Deposit
    Assets:Bank                           $5 = $15
    Income:Salary

2024/03/02 After the future deposit
    Assets:Bank                           $1 = $116
    Income:Interest

2024/03/03 In order again
    Assets:Bank                           $1 = $117
    Income:Interest

; A transaction repeating a UUID is discarded after its postings were
; registered; a later assertion must not count them.
2024/04/01 First copy
    ; UUID: 0123
    Assets:Bank                          $10 = $127
    Income:Salary

2024/04/01 First copy
    ; UUID: 0123
    Assets:Bank                          $10 = $127
    Income:Salary

2024/04/02 After the duplicate
    Assets:Bank                           $1 = $128
    Income:Interest

; Real and virtual postings to one account: a virtual assertion reads the
; combined total, a real one only the real postings (#543).
2024/05/01 Virtual
    (Assets:Bank)                        $50 = $178

2024/05/02 Real
    Assets:Bank                           $2 = $130
    Income:Interest

2024/05/03 Virtual again
    (Assets:Bank)                         $0 = $180

; A timelog posting is registered with its account once, so an
; assertion and an assignment after a clock pair count its hours once.
i 2024/06/01 09:00:00 Hours:Project
o 2024/06/01 10:30:00

2024/06/02 Check hours
    Hours:Project                          0s = 5400s
    Equity:Hours

i 2024/06/03 09:00:00 Hours:Project
o 2024/06/03 09:30:00

2024/06/04 Settle hours
    Hours:Project                             = 0s
    Equity:Hours

test bal Assets
                $180  Assets:Bank
end test

test bal Assets --verify
                $180  Assets:Bank
end test

test reg Hours
24-Jun-01                       Hours:Project                 1.50h        1.50h
24-Jun-03                       Hours:Project                 30.0m        2.00h
24-Jun-04 Settle hours          Hours:Project                -2.00h            0
                                Equity:Hours                  2.00h        2.00h
end test
